{
 "duration": 26.47,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Maya has hiked five national parks, and she can't remember most of them.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 4.323
  },
  {
   "text": "Which trail was it in Zion? How many miles? Who came along? It's all lost in two thousand photos.",
   "start": 4.573,
   "end": 10.746
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix. After every park, fill in one page: the date, the trail, the miles, who came along, and the highlight.",
   "start": 11.096,
   "end": 18.21
  },
  {
   "text": "Then color in a circle for that park, and watch the count climb.",
   "start": 18.41,
   "end": 21.921
  },
  {
   "text": "Now every park has its story.",
   "start": 22.271,
   "end": 23.976
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next park trip.",
   "start": 24.376,
   "end": 26.27
  }
 ],
